    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the fast-paced world of <strong>Turbo Balls</strong>, an exhilarating multiplayer game full of competition, adrenaline, and the thrill of race victory! Choose your unique character, customize your ball with various skins, and challenge up to 8 players in real-time matches.<strong>  </strong><strong><br>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Races:</strong> Navigate tricky obstacle courses, narrow paths without guardrails, and sharp turns as you try not to fall into the abyss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coin Collection:</strong> Explore the tracks, collect coins, and upgrade your ball to outperform your rivals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards:</strong> Climb the global rankings and prove you\u2019re the best among players from around the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skins and Customization:</strong> Unlock new ball skins to stand out on the track and showcase your personal style.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the fast-paced world of <strong>Turbo Balls</strong>, an exhilarating multiplayer game full of competition, adrenaline, and the thrill of race victory! Choose your unique character, customize your ball with various skins, and challenge up to 8 players in real-time matches.<strong>  </strong><strong><br>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Races:</strong> Navigate tricky obstacle courses, narrow paths without guardrails, and sharp turns as you try not to fall into the abyss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coin Collection:</strong> Explore the tracks, collect coins, and upgrade your ball to outperform your rivals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards:</strong> Climb the global rankings and prove you\u2019re the best among players from around the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skins and Customization:</strong> Unlock new ball skins to stand out on the track and showcase your personal style.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Race through tricky tracks with up to 8 players online. Roll, jump, and bump past opponents to reach the finish line first! Choose your character, and customize your ball.",
